#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:26
msgid ""
"``AgentBase`` **直接拥有** 所有通用能力：workspace 绑定、技能运行时（``AgentSkillRuntime``）、 ReAct "
"工具循环、LLM 调用、TODO 状态、trace、``AGENT.json`` 持久化。它**没有 mixin、没有多继承**。"
msgstr ""
"``AgentBase`` **directly owns** all generic capabilities: workspace binding, the "
"skill runtime (``AgentSkillRuntime``), the ReAct tool loop, LLM calls, TODO state, "
"trace, and ``AGENT.json`` persistence. It has **no mixins and no multiple "
"inheritance**."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:28
msgid "``PersonAgent`` 只实现面向人物的逻辑（memory、person prompt、daily-guidance 等行为），其余全部继承自基类。"
msgstr ""
"``PersonAgent`` only implements person-specific logic, such as memory, the person "
"prompt, and daily-guidance behavior; everything else is inherited from the base "
"class."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:29
