#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:102
msgid "ReAct 工具循环"
msgstr "ReAct Tool Loop"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:101
msgid ""
"``PersonAgent.step()`` / ``ask()`` 的核心是基类提供的 "
"``run_react_loop``：每轮让模型提交一个结构化工具决策，运行时校验、执行并把结果写回上下文，循环直至 ``finish`` 或回合上限。这把 LLM "
"的自由生成限制在可审计的工具结果里，也方便 replay 复盘。"
msgstr ""
"The core of ``PersonAgent.step()`` / ``ask()`` is the base-class ``run_react_loop``: in each "
"round the model submits one structured tool decision; the runtime validates it, executes it, and "
"writes the result back into context, looping until ``finish`` or the turn limit. This constrains "
"free-form LLM generation to auditable tool results and also makes replay review easier."

