msgstr "End the current simulation step, optionally with a summary."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:124
msgid "模型每轮的输出被解析为一个结构化决策（工具名 + 参数 + 是否结束）。无效工具名会被纠正或返回可恢复错误，不会直接崩溃。"
msgstr ""
"Each model turn is parsed into a structured decision: tool name, arguments, and whether to "
"finish. Invalid tool names are corrected or returned as recoverable errors instead of crashing."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:126
msgid ""
"一次 ``run_react_loop`` 只构建**一个** thread：首条消息由 ``build_react_messages`` 产出（system + 含各上下文档的 "
"user），之后每轮的 assistant 工具调用与其结果**追加**到末尾，不再重建。这样每个请求都是上一个的严格前缀扩展，provider 的 prompt "
"前缀缓存能随轮次增长而不是每轮归零。实际缓存命中取决于模型服务与请求内容；在轮内重建或从头部截断 thread 会破坏已有前缀。工具结果以 ``role: \"tool\"`` "
"消息返回（失败时带 ``ERROR:`` 前缀）；模型若以文本而非原生 tool call 发起调用，结果则作为 ``<recent_observations>`` user 块追加。步内改动了"
" ``<todo_context>`` / 激活 skill 时，会追加一条刷新块而不是重渲染（见 "
"``AgentBase.build_context_refresh_message``）。工具结果同时写入磁盘 JSONL 供 replay 复盘。"
msgstr ""
"Each ``run_react_loop`` builds **one** thread. ``build_react_messages`` creates the initial "
"system/user messages; subsequent assistant tool calls and results are **appended**. Requests "
"extend the same prefix, allowing provider prompt-prefix caching. Actual cache hits depend on the "
"service and request content; rebuilding or truncating the thread head breaks that prefix. Tool "
"results use ``role: \"tool\"`` messages, with ``ERROR:`` on failures. Text-based tool requests "
"instead receive a ``<recent_observations>`` user block. Changes to ``<todo_context>`` or "
"activated skills append a refresh block rather than rerendering the thread (see "
"``AgentBase.build_context_refresh_message``). Tool results are also written to JSONL for replay."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:147
msgid "TODO 状态"
msgstr "TODO State"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:141
msgid ""
"基类内置一组 TODO 工具（``todo_list`` / ``todo_add`` / ``todo_update`` / ``todo_start`` / "
"``todo_complete`` / ``todo_defer`` / ``todo_clear_completed``），让 agent 可以显式维护待办清单。 TODO 条目用 UUID "
"标识，自动归档，可通过 ``dispatch_todo_tool`` 分发；目的是让多步计划在跨 tick 之间可追踪、可恢复。"
msgstr ""
"The base class includes a set of TODO tools (``todo_list`` / ``todo_add`` / ``todo_update`` / "
"``todo_start`` / ``todo_complete`` / ``todo_defer`` / ``todo_clear_completed``) so agents can "
"explicitly maintain a task list. TODO items are identified by UUID, archived automatically, and "
"dispatched through ``dispatch_todo_tool``. The goal is to make multi-step plans traceable and "
"recoverable across ticks."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:156
msgid "工作区布局"
msgstr "Workspace Layout"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:158
msgid "每个 agent 拥有独立工作区，是它的唯一持久状态来源："
msgstr "Each agent has an independent workspace, which is its only source of persistent state:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:151
msgid ""
"<run_dir>/agents/agent_XXXX/\n"
"├── config.json            # 静态配置（create 时写一次，不再重写）\n"
"├── AGENT.json             # 动态自描述快照（每步 to_workspace 时更新）\n"
"├── state/                 # 技能与自定义状态文件（如 daily_guidance/）\n"
"├── TODO.json              # 跨步待办清单\n"
"├── MEMORY.md              # 跨 step 运行时记忆摘要\n"
"├── memory/\n"
"│   ├── episodes.jsonl     # 事件记忆\n"
"│   └── state.json         # 记忆运行时状态\n"
"└── custom/skills/         # 自定义技能目录（热加载）"
msgstr ""
"<run_dir>/agents/agent_XXXX/\n"
"├── config.json            # Static configuration written once by create\n"
"├── AGENT.json             # Dynamic snapshot updated by to_workspace each step\n"
"├── state/                 # Skill and custom state, such as daily_guidance/\n"
"├── TODO.json              # Cross-step task list\n"
"├── MEMORY.md              # Cross-step runtime memory summary\n"
"├── memory/\n"
"│   ├── episodes.jsonl     # Event memories\n"
"│   └── state.json         # Memory runtime state\n"
"└── custom/skills/         # Custom skill directory, hot-loaded"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents.rst:164
msgid ""
"``config.json`` 是静态的；``AGENT.json`` 由 ``persist_agent_json``（调 ``build_agent_json``）在 "
"``to_workspace`` 时写回，是 agent 对自己的自描述快照（含 ``world_description`` 等字段，供 Ray 重建时从磁盘恢复；注入 prompt 的 "
"``<agent>`` 视图会剥离该字段以免与 ``<world>`` 重复）。工具、技能脚本与 LLM 调用日志写入 ``<run_dir>/trace/trace_<xx>.jsonl`` "
"分片。跨 step 的运行时摘要见 ``MEMORY.md``。"
msgstr ""
"``config.json`` is static; ``AGENT.json`` is written by ``persist_agent_json`` (calling "
"``build_agent_json``) during ``to_workspace``. It is the agent self-description snapshot, "
"including fields such as ``world_description``, restored from disk by Ray. The ``<agent>`` prompt"
" view strips that field to avoid duplicating ``<world>``. Tool, skill script, and LLM call logs "
"are written to ``<run_dir>/trace/trace_<xx>.jsonl`` shards. Cross-step runtime summaries are "
"stored in ``MEMORY.md``."

