#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents/configuration.rst:45
msgid ""
"绝大多数研究者并不直接调 ``create`` / ``from_workspace``，而是通过 ``AgentSociety`` + ``InitConfig`` 声明 "
"agent，由编排器在实验启动时批量创建（见下方 :ref:`agent-config` 与 :doc:`/cli`）。下面仅展示底层契约，便于理解与扩展："
msgstr ""
"Most researchers do not call ``create`` / ``from_workspace`` directly. Instead, they declare "
"agents through ``AgentSociety`` + ``InitConfig``, and the orchestrator creates them in batches "
"when the experiment starts (see :ref:`agent-config` and :doc:`/cli` below). The following only "
"shows the low-level contract for understanding and extension:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/agents/configuration.rst:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2 import PersonAgent\n"
"from agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy import ServiceProxy\n"
"\n"
"workspace = Path(\"run/agents/agent_0001\")\n"
"\n"
"# 1) 写一次 workspace（config.json + 初始 AGENT.json）\n"
"PersonAgent.create(\n"
"    workspace,\n"
"    profile={\"id\": 1, \"name\": \"Alice\", \"age\": 28, \"bio\": \"A software engineer.\"},\n"
"    config={},\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 2) 重建 ready agent（需要 ServiceProxy 注入 env/llm/trace/replay）\n"
"agent = await PersonAgent.from_workspace(workspace, service_proxy)"
msgstr ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2 import PersonAgent\n"
"from agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy import ServiceProxy\n"
"\n"
"workspace = Path(\"run/agents/agent_0001\")\n"
"\n"
"# 1) Write the workspace once (config.json and initial AGENT.json)\n"
"PersonAgent.create(\n"
"    workspace,\n"
"    profile={\"id\": 1, \"name\": \"Alice\", \"age\": 28, \"bio\": \"A software engineer.\"},\n"
"    config={},\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 2) Rebuild a ready agent with ServiceProxy for env/llm/trace/replay\n"
"agent = await PersonAgent.from_workspace(workspace, service_proxy)"

